{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two crews, one lively city, and a whole lot of \u201cwhaaat ?!\u201d In LootScoot, Thieves sprint for big payouts while Cops try to shut the show down. With gadgets, teamwork, and a dose of chaos. It\u2019s bright, cheeky, and built for quick, replayable matches where every corner can flip the script.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/extras/5fef26cca93848ce318777148202af63.avif?t=1761568107\" width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thieves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into shops, grab the cash, and deliver it to a hidden contact before the sirens catch up. Bigger hauls paint a bigger target\u2014so plan your route, use disguises, and let your friends create \u201caccidental\u201d distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol hot spots, read the map, and pounce on suspicious movement. Box in suspects, cut off escape lanes, and coordinate takedowns to keep the streets in one piece (more or less).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How You Win</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves win by hitting the cash goal before the timer runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cops win if the clock hits zero and the thieves come up short, late game helicopters make hiding a lot harder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE NEED YOU !!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/extras/0946f1f991b1f122af00d30e1e374b73.avif?t=1761568107\" width=1512 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Boss:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThink fast, look normal, and bring home something shiny. My crew loves a generous rookie.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheriff:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Badge up, rookie. The city\u2019s loud, the streets are wild, and we\u2019re here to make it a good day.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side, grab your friends, and dive into a playful cops-and-robbers sprint where every match tells a new \u201cyou had to be there\u201d story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665540?t=1761568107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/3121d9d13dbb9a120ffc1fec4fc9445483bd0459/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761568107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/597925d2be1241bb6d6073ef767ef7d1418f88fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761568107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/597925d2be1241bb6d6073ef767ef7d1418f88fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761568107","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two crews, one lively city, and a whole lot of \u201cwhaaat ?!\u201d In LootScoot, Thieves sprint for big payouts while Cops try to shut the show down. With gadgets, teamwork, and a dose of chaos. It\u2019s bright, cheeky, and built for quick, replayable matches where every corner can flip the script.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt